1
00:01:30,410 --> 00:01:34,970
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,620 --> 00:01:37,940
[Episode 7]

3
00:01:57,759 --> 00:02:00,790
We sent her to deliver invitations
for the charity sale.

4
00:02:00,790 --> 00:02:02,280
Is there a problem with that?

5
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,610
Just a routine inquiry. Don't be nervous.

6
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:05,400
Take a picture.

7
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,940
[Shanghai Ciji Foundation
Membership Application Form]

8
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:08,419
This is Shen Kexi's file
at the Ciji Foundation.

9
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:12,030
Volunteer Shen
has been here for almost a year.

10
00:02:12,310 --> 00:02:14,170
She mainly works the night shift,

11
00:02:14,270 --> 00:02:16,870
and she only interacts with people
from Ciji Foundation

12
00:02:16,870 --> 00:02:18,470
and those receiving relief.

13
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:21,280
Her social life is very simple and clean.

14
00:02:22,150 --> 00:02:24,630
No. 76 must have made a mistake.

15
00:02:24,750 --> 00:02:26,350
Where does she usually live?

16
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,750
We have our own dormitory.

17
00:02:27,750 --> 00:02:28,980
Everyone lives together.

18
00:02:28,980 --> 00:02:30,100
Okay, thank you.

19
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,640
Did you take the picture?

20
00:02:35,870 --> 00:02:36,560
I did.

21
00:02:47,310 --> 00:02:49,310
This is your first time here, right?

22
00:03:08,870 --> 00:03:10,800
Are you thinking about that woman?

23
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,560
Will she die?

24
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,910
You said she's a Communist.

25
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,600
She denied it.

26
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,770
Her feet were nailed to the ground,

27
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,450
and she still denied it.

28
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:30,570
Communists are pretty much all like that.

29
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,130
What do you think...

30
00:03:36,630 --> 00:03:37,870
faith is?

31
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,750
Probably something worth living for.

32
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,079
Do you have it?

33
00:03:50,590 --> 00:03:51,850
You definitely don't.

34
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,120
I do.

35
00:03:58,340 --> 00:03:59,690
Cigarettes, alcohol,

36
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,160
and beautiful women.

37
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,750
Are all the people from No. 76

38
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,430
like you,

39
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,380
selfish, hedonistic,

40
00:04:11,870 --> 00:04:12,870
and heartless?

41
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:16,750
Aren't you also working for No. 76?

42
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,310
I'm not like you.

43
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:20,329
How are you different?

44
00:04:22,310 --> 00:04:23,630
You are too cruel.

45
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,800
You're not human.

46
00:04:28,070 --> 00:04:31,000
Sometimes what you see
isn't necessarily the truth.

47
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,480
Do you still need the pictures?

48
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,040
They don't prove she's a Communist.

49
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,900
Handing them in would be useless.

50
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:47,440
Su Causeway has been arrested.

51
00:04:46,030 --> 00:04:47,350
[Yan'an]

52
00:04:47,380 --> 00:04:52,159
[He Yufeng, Chief of the CCP
Enemy Area Work Department]

53
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,360
Requesting rescue.

54
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:50,920
Diana.

55
00:04:53,270 --> 00:04:53,950
Reply.

56
00:04:55,070 --> 00:04:56,400
Awaken Leifeng Pagoda.

57
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,420
Taking photos?

58
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:06,510
I'm Xin Xiang.

59
00:05:05,870 --> 00:05:08,020
[Xin Xiang, Photo Studio Apprentice]

60
00:05:06,510 --> 00:05:08,040
I'm the new shop assistant.

61
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,360
Jinbao.

62
00:05:16,830 --> 00:05:17,600
Jinbao!

63
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:18,630
What?

64
00:05:19,190 --> 00:05:20,590
Who's the guy at the door?

65
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,830
You spend all your time

66
00:05:25,830 --> 00:05:27,360
with that female official.

67
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,670
If we don't find someone
to watch the shop,

68
00:05:29,670 --> 00:05:31,270
it'll close sooner or later.

69
00:05:32,470 --> 00:05:33,730
Where did you find him?

70
00:05:33,870 --> 00:05:35,440
Let him learn photography from you.

71
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,909
He's cheap and obedient.

72
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,760
Aren't you coming in?

73
00:05:43,310 --> 00:05:44,440
This is your master.

74
00:05:44,570 --> 00:05:46,100
Introduce yourself first.

75
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,120
Hello, I'm Xin Xiang.

76
00:05:49,190 --> 00:05:51,120
I worked at Sanchuan Photo Studio before,

77
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,390
but my master's skills were poor,

78
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:53,390
so I jumped ship.

79
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:54,810
I'm not stupid.

80
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,950
In a place like that, even if I worked

81
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:56,800
until I was 99,

82
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,950
I'd never make it.

83
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:00,160
As if you could live to 99.

84
00:06:01,390 --> 00:06:01,950
Right.

85
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:03,880
Whatever you say is right, Master.

86
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,360
I'm not your master.

87
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,720
I'm your boss.

88
00:06:06,870 --> 00:06:07,600
Nonsense.

89
00:06:07,980 --> 00:06:08,860
I'm the boss.

90
00:06:11,310 --> 00:06:12,870
There's an empty room for you
by the stairs.

91
00:06:12,870 --> 00:06:14,060
Go upstairs and get your things together.

92
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:14,830
Okay, Boss.

93
00:06:33,190 --> 00:06:34,590
Don't smile so creepily.

94
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:37,360
Boss, come.

95
00:06:37,650 --> 00:06:38,420
Sit, sit.

96
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,580
Can you lend me some money?

97
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,560
For what?

98
00:06:45,750 --> 00:06:46,680
To save someone.

99
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:48,430
Who?

100
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,510
My cousin.

101
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:52,070
Your cousin?

102
00:06:53,190 --> 00:06:54,310
How come you suddenly

103
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:55,920
have a cousin in Shanghai?

104
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:58,390
It's the lady who came here

105
00:06:58,390 --> 00:06:59,520
when we just opened.

106
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,650
You said she looked like a star.

107
00:07:05,550 --> 00:07:06,610
She's your cousin?

108
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:09,140
Who are you trying to fool?

109
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:11,880
She looked familiar
the last time I saw her.

110
00:07:12,190 --> 00:07:15,430
We ran into each other again later
and recognized each other.

111
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:18,040
She was caught by No. 76.

112
00:07:18,430 --> 00:07:20,030
They said she's a Communist.

113
00:07:20,630 --> 00:07:21,510
So is she?

114
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,630
They pierced her feet,

115
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:24,950
and she still denied it.

116
00:07:24,950 --> 00:07:26,000
What do you think?

117
00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:27,770
So cruel?

118
00:07:32,510 --> 00:07:33,640
How much do you want?

119
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:34,750
5,000.

120
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,190
Also,

121
00:07:37,070 --> 00:07:38,480
you know a lot of people.

122
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,400
Can you ask around
to see who can get her out?

123
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,870
Cang Guanglian from last time
definitely won't do.

124
00:07:43,870 --> 00:07:45,000
He's a fraud.

125
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,750
How about 10,000?

126
00:07:48,870 --> 00:07:50,670
5,000 is indeed a bit too little.

127
00:07:51,270 --> 00:07:52,190
Go to sleep.

128
00:07:52,530 --> 00:07:54,310
You can have anything in your dreams.

129
00:07:54,310 --> 00:07:56,070
A life is at stake.
You can't just leave her to die.

130
00:07:56,070 --> 00:07:57,870
My cousin is definitely a good person.

131
00:07:57,870 --> 00:07:58,730
Let me tell you,

132
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:01,390
I only care about money now, not people.

133
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:03,750
I just think

134
00:08:04,270 --> 00:08:06,120
you're the best person in the world,

135
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,450
so I came to you for help.

136
00:08:07,630 --> 00:08:08,830
Flattery won't work.

137
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:12,400
You dare to get involved with anything
related to the Communist Party?

138
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:14,400
You'll get yourself killed one day.

139
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:15,950
She's your cousin,

140
00:08:16,190 --> 00:08:17,310
not your father.

141
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:20,020
Anyway, I have to save her.

142
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,750
If you get yourself killed,

143
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:23,270
find a place to bury yourself.

144
00:08:23,270 --> 00:08:24,870
I won't collect your corpse.

145
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:27,770
Didn't you help me
when I was in trouble last time?

146
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:30,120
You have a mind of your own.

147
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,050
I can't stop you.

148
00:08:31,390 --> 00:08:32,919
Think it through yourself.

149
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:35,000
Since No. 76 says she's a Communist,

150
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:38,340
it's impossible to get her out
just by spending some money.

151
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:41,200
Everyone went to the ball!

152
00:09:41,870 --> 00:09:42,870
And I had to spend

153
00:09:42,910 --> 00:09:45,720
the whole night here because of you!

154
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,720
Kill me.

155
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,530
What did you say?

156
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,480
Kill me.

157
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,550
Kill you?

158
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,080
I won't.

159
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,260
I'll give you one more chance.

160
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:09,880
Will you talk?

161
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:17,600
If you're happy,
why don't you have a drink with me?

162
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,390
Alright, stop talking.

163
00:10:18,390 --> 00:10:19,200
Dance with me.

164
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:19,960
Director Li.

165
00:10:21,070 --> 00:10:21,670
Okay.

166
00:10:42,390 --> 00:10:43,320
Got a cigarette?

167
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:56,780
You should be more of a gentleman.

168
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,270
Nice ring.

169
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,610
Where did you buy it?

170
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:24,010
I had a silversmith make it.

171
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:28,440
You can't buy such a good ring.

172
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,730
Which silversmith?

173
00:11:49,750 --> 00:11:51,390
Hello, Leifeng Pagoda.

174
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,840
The Organization has decided

175
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:04,640
to rescue Shen Kexi at all costs.

176
00:12:05,750 --> 00:12:06,510
How?

177
00:12:13,750 --> 00:12:15,150
Aren't we going to dance?

178
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,550
Her feet are nailed to the ground.

179
00:12:17,550 --> 00:12:19,280
How can I be in the mood to dance?

180
00:12:24,860 --> 00:12:26,920
Find a way to send her to the hospital.

181
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,120
Inspector Su.

182
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:40,650
I... I want to ask you for a dance.

183
00:12:42,630 --> 00:12:43,960
Do you know how to dance?

184
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,010
You can teach me.

185
00:12:46,150 --> 00:12:48,750
There are plenty of dancers
at Great Shanghai Ballroom.

186
00:12:48,750 --> 00:12:50,410
Find them if you want to learn.

187
00:12:52,870 --> 00:12:53,720
Inspector Su,

188
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:56,520
I want to show you something.

189
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:03,060
I've been to the Ciji Foundation.

190
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,540
She really is a volunteer.

191
00:13:04,550 --> 00:13:06,610
She's been working there for a while.

192
00:13:07,150 --> 00:13:09,750
It was just her job
to deliver things to Ouyang.

193
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:11,200
This is the evidence.

194
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:29,120
Didn't you want to ask me for a dance?

195
00:13:43,190 --> 00:13:45,190
What's your relationship with her?

196
00:13:46,150 --> 00:13:47,000
No lying.

197
00:13:48,910 --> 00:13:50,910
We knew each other when we were kids.

198
00:13:51,150 --> 00:13:51,960
She took

199
00:13:52,390 --> 00:13:54,050
some photos at my shop before.

200
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,240
Are you very close?

201
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:58,080
No.

202
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:01,440
Then why?

203
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:05,080
Playing the hero saving the beauty?

204
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:06,510
I'm not a hero.

205
00:14:08,340 --> 00:14:10,340
I'm someone who was wronged by them.

206
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:11,870
So is she.

207
00:14:13,670 --> 00:14:14,630
I said,

208
00:14:15,270 --> 00:14:16,320
no lying.

209
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,270
I'm not lying.

210
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:21,540
She's a good person, not a Communist.

211
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:25,400
That's a dangerous thing to say.

212
00:14:25,630 --> 00:14:27,160
I haven't told anyone else.

213
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:30,980
Then why did you come to me?

214
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:34,650
I think you're different from the others.

215
00:14:38,870 --> 00:14:39,720
You're wrong.

216
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:41,980
I'm just like Li Moqun.

217
00:14:42,570 --> 00:14:44,230
We both work for the Japanese.

218
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:45,750
Just like you said,

219
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:47,250
we are traitors.

220
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:50,720
But she really is a good person.

221
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:51,750
I have proof.

222
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,510
At No. 76,

223
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:56,760
proof is the most useless thing.

224
00:14:57,670 --> 00:14:59,000
Don't mention it again.

225
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:02,780
So you're just going to watch
an innocent person

226
00:15:03,390 --> 00:15:04,200
be framed?

227
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:06,480
Watch your mouth.

228
00:15:07,030 --> 00:15:08,550
If you don't want it anymore,

229
00:15:08,550 --> 00:15:09,550
just say the word.

230
00:15:12,790 --> 00:15:13,630
Inspector Su,

231
00:15:14,750 --> 00:15:16,720
if this is the kind of person you are,

232
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:18,720
I don't want to work for you anymore.

233
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:20,830
I'm afraid karma will catch up with me.

234
00:15:20,830 --> 00:15:21,830
Stop right there.

235
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:28,010
Do you know why I'm not helping you?

236
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,040
Because your dancing

237
00:15:33,270 --> 00:15:34,320
is terrible.

238
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:37,980
Give me back the photo.

239
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,730
I'll burn it for you.

240
00:15:42,630 --> 00:15:44,090
It's dangerous to keep it.

241
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:01,550
I could only hold my camera like an idiot,

242
00:16:04,030 --> 00:16:06,090
standing there watching her suffer,

243
00:16:08,040 --> 00:16:09,300
unable to do anything.

244
00:16:11,150 --> 00:16:12,790
I told you a long time ago,

245
00:16:13,870 --> 00:16:15,030
in these times,

246
00:16:15,390 --> 00:16:17,240
a camera can't save lives.

247
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:23,030
At that moment, I wished

248
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:26,080
I had a gun in my hand.

249
00:16:27,390 --> 00:16:30,240
I would point it at
that bastard Cang Guanglian's head

250
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:31,600
and blow his brains out.

251
00:16:36,750 --> 00:16:38,720
You're finally getting it.

252
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:41,960
I'm telling you,

253
00:16:42,550 --> 00:16:44,150
learn from me,

254
00:16:44,750 --> 00:16:46,880
and that day will come sooner or later.

255
00:16:48,510 --> 00:16:49,870
Blow his brains out.

256
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:54,440
Blow his brains out.

257
00:17:07,109 --> 00:17:08,310
But right now,

258
00:17:09,349 --> 00:17:10,349
I'm useless.

259
00:17:12,030 --> 00:17:13,349
I can't save her.

260
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:15,680
It's okay.

261
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:17,750
I'll help you.

262
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,000
You?

263
00:17:22,839 --> 00:17:24,550
I am Battalion Commander Du.

264
00:17:26,109 --> 00:17:27,270
Give me a gun,

265
00:17:28,270 --> 00:17:31,130
and those idiots
won't be enough for me to deal with.

266
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:34,160
Brother.

267
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,240
From today on,

268
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:39,070
you are my brother.

269
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,960
Let's charge in together

270
00:17:42,750 --> 00:17:45,110
and put that bastard Cang down, okay?

271
00:17:47,790 --> 00:17:49,110
Blow his brains out!

272
00:18:03,550 --> 00:18:05,000
Be honest with me.

273
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:09,030
Is she really a Communist?

274
00:18:37,510 --> 00:18:38,120
Boss.

275
00:18:38,470 --> 00:18:40,400
No. 76 is too greedy.

276
00:18:40,510 --> 00:18:42,440
They extorted 300,000 silver dollars
at once.

277
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,440
That's 300,000 silver dollars.

278
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:45,640
I've never seen so much money in my life.

279
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:46,720
Look.

280
00:18:51,650 --> 00:18:53,880
[Flour King Slams No. 76
for Kidnapping and Extortion]

281
00:18:59,070 --> 00:19:00,270
Where is Chen Kailai?

282
00:19:01,790 --> 00:19:02,880
He drank too much last night.

283
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:04,610
He's probably still sleeping.

284
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:07,200
Chen Kailai!

285
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:13,200
Chen Kailai!

286
00:19:14,180 --> 00:19:15,050
Get up!

287
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:17,270
Don't bother me.

288
00:19:17,510 --> 00:19:18,960
I'm not going to No. 76.

289
00:19:20,030 --> 00:19:20,880
Look at this.

290
00:19:21,350 --> 00:19:22,240
What?

291
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,310
It's not the first time

292
00:19:25,310 --> 00:19:26,550
No. 76 has done this.

293
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:28,660
But this time, it's become a big deal.

294
00:19:28,660 --> 00:19:31,460
People outside are protesting
about your cousin.

295
00:19:32,350 --> 00:19:34,170
No more unjust persecution!

296
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:36,120
No more unjust persecution!

297
00:19:36,140 --> 00:19:37,830
No more kidnapping and brutality!

298
00:19:37,830 --> 00:19:39,630
No more kidnapping and brutality!

299
00:19:39,630 --> 00:19:41,370
Release the innocent volunteer!

300
00:19:41,370 --> 00:19:43,110
Release the innocent volunteer!

301
00:19:43,110 --> 00:19:45,000
No more unjust persecution!

302
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:46,960
No more unjust persecution!

303
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:48,880
Idiot!

304
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:53,080
If you had gotten something
out of her earlier,

305
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:55,360
would things have turned out like this?

306
00:19:55,790 --> 00:19:59,190
Director, I specifically checked
with the Ciji Foundation.

307
00:19:59,270 --> 00:20:01,070
She is indeed a volunteer there.

308
00:20:01,350 --> 00:20:03,580
And it's true
that she was delivering invitations

309
00:20:03,580 --> 00:20:04,790
to past donors.

310
00:20:04,830 --> 00:20:05,390
Well...

311
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:09,030
Did we...

312
00:20:09,640 --> 00:20:11,720
catch the wrong person?

313
00:20:16,550 --> 00:20:17,440
Did we?

314
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:22,400
No.

315
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:24,220
We definitely didn't.

316
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:25,970
This woman must be a Communist.

317
00:20:26,270 --> 00:20:26,990
Why?

318
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,090
Wh-

319
00:20:30,110 --> 00:20:31,240
She's too stubborn.

320
00:20:36,030 --> 00:20:37,720
No more unjust persecution!

321
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:39,590
No more unjust persecution!

322
00:20:39,590 --> 00:20:41,270
No more kidnapping and brutality!

323
00:20:41,270 --> 00:20:43,200
No more kidnapping and brutality!

324
00:20:49,300 --> 00:20:50,900
You need to be more ruthless.

325
00:20:51,670 --> 00:20:52,890
I'm afraid she can't take it.

326
00:20:52,890 --> 00:20:54,420
I can barely take it myself!

327
00:20:55,510 --> 00:20:56,480
Before dark,

328
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,680
no matter what it takes,

329
00:20:57,680 --> 00:20:59,350
you must make her talk!

330
00:20:59,550 --> 00:21:00,280
Understood.

331
00:21:04,370 --> 00:21:05,630
Where is Captain Cang?

332
00:21:06,510 --> 00:21:07,920
He was called away by Director Li.

333
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:08,740
Pan-fried buns.

334
00:21:08,740 --> 00:21:09,600
From Dahuchun.

335
00:21:09,830 --> 00:21:11,270
Thank you, Section Chief Zhao.

336
00:21:11,270 --> 00:21:12,470
She still won't talk?

337
00:21:12,790 --> 00:21:14,190
No, she still won't talk.

338
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:22,790
Is she awake?

339
00:21:26,110 --> 00:21:28,110
I've never seen anyone so stubborn!

340
00:21:29,270 --> 00:21:30,240
Why so angry?

341
00:21:30,590 --> 00:21:31,590
Because of her.

342
00:21:32,070 --> 00:21:33,530
I haven't eaten all night.

343
00:21:34,640 --> 00:21:35,270
If she still won't talk,

344
00:21:35,270 --> 00:21:37,400
it means your methods aren't working.

345
00:21:39,200 --> 00:21:40,260
To deal with women,

346
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:42,940
you have to use
both the carrot and the stick.

347
00:21:45,070 --> 00:21:47,000
I just finished appeasing Director Li.

348
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:48,550
Now I have to coax her?

349
00:21:48,760 --> 00:21:49,820
Am I that pathetic?

350
00:21:50,270 --> 00:21:52,800
I'm worried
you've been hitting her too hard.

351
00:21:53,030 --> 00:21:54,550
Before you can make her talk,

352
00:21:54,550 --> 00:21:55,960
what if she dies?

353
00:21:56,380 --> 00:21:58,240
If she's sent to the hospital
and they can't save her,

354
00:21:58,240 --> 00:21:59,840
who's going to take the fall?

355
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:03,260
Why don't you do it?

356
00:22:03,640 --> 00:22:05,030
Help me out.

357
00:22:05,520 --> 00:22:06,980
I haven't slept all night.

358
00:22:07,750 --> 00:22:09,550
I can't do interrogations.

359
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:12,440
The Logistics Section only delivers food.

360
00:22:16,720 --> 00:22:18,520
You just know how to mess with me.

361
00:22:21,510 --> 00:22:23,680
You are a hot potato.

362
00:22:25,540 --> 00:22:26,190
Brother,

363
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:29,010
the Director's throwing another fit.

364
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:30,550
They're gathering at our door.

365
00:22:30,550 --> 00:22:31,950
How could he not be angry?

366
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:38,110
You are really tough.

367
00:22:47,350 --> 00:22:48,550
She passed out again.

368
00:22:50,670 --> 00:22:51,790
Get some water. Get some water.

369
00:22:51,790 --> 00:22:52,640
Wake her up!

370
00:22:55,830 --> 00:22:57,200
It's raining so hard outside.

371
00:22:57,200 --> 00:22:58,460
Did you take a car here?

372
00:22:59,510 --> 00:23:00,510
I took the tram.

373
00:23:01,310 --> 00:23:02,920
When the driver comes back later,

374
00:23:02,920 --> 00:23:04,310
I'll have him take you home.

375
00:23:04,310 --> 00:23:05,510
Please don't bother.

376
00:23:05,750 --> 00:23:07,000
On the way here just now,

377
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:08,460
I passed by Jing'an Temple

378
00:23:08,510 --> 00:23:10,170
and saw several tailor shops.

379
00:23:10,510 --> 00:23:11,840
I'd like to look around.

380
00:23:12,110 --> 00:23:13,150
Miss Ouyang,

381
00:23:13,170 --> 00:23:15,230
do you have any tailors to recommend?

382
00:23:15,310 --> 00:23:17,110
It's hard for me to recommend it.

383
00:23:17,510 --> 00:23:19,310
Miss Shen, you're so beautiful.

384
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:21,060
You'll look good in anything.

385
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:25,900
From the Ciji Foundation
to Ouyang's house,

386
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:27,960
you don't pass by Jing'an Temple at all.

387
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:30,090
They are in two different directions.

388
00:23:30,240 --> 00:23:31,510
So I think

389
00:23:32,070 --> 00:23:33,400
she was testing the waters,

390
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:34,270
or rather,

391
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:35,920
it's a secret signal.

392
00:23:41,830 --> 00:23:44,310
In that case, she really is fishy.

393
00:23:48,750 --> 00:23:50,590
Release the innocent volunteer!

394
00:23:50,590 --> 00:23:52,240
Release the innocent volunteer!

395
00:23:52,240 --> 00:23:54,070
No more unjust persecution!

396
00:23:54,070 --> 00:23:55,920
No more unjust persecution!

397
00:23:55,960 --> 00:23:57,640
No more kidnapping and brutality!

398
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:59,480
No more kidnapping and brutality!

399
00:23:59,480 --> 00:24:00,920
Release the innocent volunteer!

400
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:02,200
Release the innocent volunteer!

401
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:04,200
But if you tell the people down there

402
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:05,920
that this woman is definitely a Communist

403
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:07,940
because she passed by Jing'an Temple,

404
00:24:07,940 --> 00:24:09,140
will they believe it?

405
00:24:09,960 --> 00:24:10,830
That's why

406
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:12,780
we need to secure her confession.

407
00:24:14,310 --> 00:24:16,310
Let me give you an idea, Director Li.

408
00:24:17,310 --> 00:24:18,350
I'm all ears.

409
00:24:20,030 --> 00:24:21,960
Since she is Ouyang's accomplice,

410
00:24:22,830 --> 00:24:25,240
we can bring Ouyang here to identify her.

411
00:24:25,820 --> 00:24:27,620
Then she won't be able to deny it.

412
00:24:28,310 --> 00:24:31,110
Ouyang is detained
by the Plum Blossom Agency.

413
00:24:33,070 --> 00:24:34,200
We can't get her out.

414
00:24:37,130 --> 00:24:39,330
You can discuss it with General Kagesa.

415
00:24:39,480 --> 00:24:41,270
There's no room for discussion.

416
00:24:41,270 --> 00:24:43,400
I might as well figure out a way myself.

417
00:24:44,310 --> 00:24:45,440
I have to say,

418
00:24:46,070 --> 00:24:47,680
Captain Cang is brave

419
00:24:47,680 --> 00:24:48,720
but lacks wisdom.

420
00:24:49,240 --> 00:24:50,400
Even if he beat her to death,

421
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:52,240
he might not get anything out of her.

422
00:24:52,240 --> 00:24:53,040
Well...

423
00:24:53,230 --> 00:24:53,840
Come in.

424
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:00,350
Director.

425
00:25:00,950 --> 00:25:03,610
That woman couldn't take it,
and she passed out.

426
00:25:09,440 --> 00:25:10,350
Go wake her up.

427
00:25:10,510 --> 00:25:11,590
We tried everything,

428
00:25:11,590 --> 00:25:13,440
but... but she didn't respond.

429
00:25:16,400 --> 00:25:18,060
Send her to the hospital then.

430
00:25:18,540 --> 00:25:19,760
What are you waiting for?

431
00:25:19,760 --> 00:25:20,750
Listen to Inspector Su

432
00:25:20,750 --> 00:25:22,220
and send her to Renji Hospital
immediately.

433
00:25:22,220 --> 00:25:22,870
Yes.

434
00:25:31,550 --> 00:25:32,410
The tea is good.

435
00:25:45,310 --> 00:25:47,240
We should go visit the wounded too.

436
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:02,410
Didn't you say you weren't coming?

437
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:04,960
You published the photo, right?

438
00:26:05,590 --> 00:26:06,270
Thank you.

439
00:26:06,590 --> 00:26:08,120
It has nothing to do with me.

440
00:26:09,790 --> 00:26:10,750
From now on,

441
00:26:10,960 --> 00:26:12,560
I'm at your service anytime.

442
00:26:13,590 --> 00:26:14,590
Bring your camera

443
00:26:14,590 --> 00:26:15,440
and let's go.

444
00:26:18,550 --> 00:26:19,680
Where are you going?

445
00:26:23,910 --> 00:26:24,970
This way! This way!

446
00:26:27,310 --> 00:26:28,070
Be careful!

447
00:26:31,160 --> 00:26:32,020
Close the door.

448
00:26:32,840 --> 00:26:33,600
Come on.

449
00:26:34,280 --> 00:26:35,200
Give me a hand. Come on.

450
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:36,130
Come on. Slowly.

451
00:26:37,510 --> 00:26:38,750
One, two, three!

452
00:26:39,920 --> 00:26:41,380
Pull it out. Open the door.

453
00:26:46,110 --> 00:26:47,370
She can still be saved.

454
00:26:49,440 --> 00:26:50,770
Clean the wounds first.

455
00:27:00,680 --> 00:27:01,740
Get him out of here.

456
00:27:02,030 --> 00:27:02,640
Yes.

457
00:27:03,330 --> 00:27:04,960
Excuse me, please go somewhere else.

458
00:27:04,960 --> 00:27:05,640
You two,

459
00:27:06,590 --> 00:27:07,790
guard that entrance.

460
00:27:08,150 --> 00:27:08,700
Yes.

461
00:27:11,030 --> 00:27:12,230
Let's go have a smoke.

462
00:27:16,380 --> 00:27:17,440
Keep a close watch.

463
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:17,960
Yes.

464
00:27:40,110 --> 00:27:41,440
Why is this woman here?

465
00:27:42,130 --> 00:27:45,990
Seems like she's visiting the wounded
from the racecourse shooting.

466
00:27:46,330 --> 00:27:48,730
She never misses a chance
to get attention.

467
00:28:02,300 --> 00:28:03,500
Get ready for action.

468
00:28:17,030 --> 00:28:17,720
Got a light?

469
00:28:20,480 --> 00:28:21,540
Here, have a smoke.

470
00:28:31,380 --> 00:28:32,410
No smoking here.

471
00:28:32,440 --> 00:28:34,170
Go outside if you want to smoke.

472
00:28:36,970 --> 00:28:38,300
Let's go smoke. Come on.

473
00:28:48,920 --> 00:28:50,120
Take good care of him.

474
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,030
Thank you.

475
00:28:51,310 --> 00:28:51,960
Thank you.

476
00:28:52,070 --> 00:28:52,720
Thank you.

477
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:57,830
Take good care of yourself.

478
00:28:57,830 --> 00:28:58,550
Thank you, officer.

479
00:28:58,550 --> 00:28:59,230
Thank you.

480
00:29:05,230 --> 00:29:06,360
Thank you very much.

481
00:29:06,390 --> 00:29:07,020
Thank you.

482
00:29:11,030 --> 00:29:12,360
I just came to visit you.

483
00:29:13,350 --> 00:29:14,030
Thank you.

484
00:29:28,040 --> 00:29:29,920
[Closed]
[Under Maintenance]

485
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:32,640
Nurse!

486
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:34,600
Are they trying to save a woman inside?

487
00:29:34,600 --> 00:29:34,990
Yes.

488
00:29:35,030 --> 00:29:36,480
In her twenties, with injured feet?

489
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,400
Is she still alive?

490
00:29:37,400 --> 00:29:38,350
If you keep stopping me
from getting medicine,

491
00:29:38,350 --> 00:29:39,260
she probably won't survive.

492
00:29:39,260 --> 00:29:40,120
Go. Go quickly.

493
00:29:46,660 --> 00:29:48,140
Doctor, come take a look!

494
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:48,750
Doctor.

495
00:29:48,780 --> 00:29:49,350
What's wrong?

496
00:29:49,350 --> 00:29:50,400
Take a look quickly, doctor.

497
00:29:50,400 --> 00:29:51,160
Doctor.

498
00:29:51,350 --> 00:29:52,300
Come and look.

499
00:29:53,200 --> 00:29:53,810
Look.

500
00:29:54,140 --> 00:29:55,870
Family members, wait outside.

501
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,880
Drive to the back door of the hospital.

502
00:30:03,880 --> 00:30:04,470
Hurry up!

503
00:30:09,650 --> 00:30:11,080
Don't be nervous. Relax.

504
00:30:11,110 --> 00:30:12,640
You're about to give birth.

505
00:30:42,010 --> 00:30:43,740
-What happened?
-Where is she?

506
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:45,410
Where is she?

507
00:30:46,750 --> 00:30:47,400
What's going on?

508
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:48,270
Where did she go?

509
00:30:48,270 --> 00:30:48,750
I don't...

510
00:30:48,750 --> 00:30:49,480
I don't know.

511
00:30:49,750 --> 00:30:50,480
Where is she?

512
00:30:50,550 --> 00:30:52,210
She was... She was taken away!

513
00:30:52,880 --> 00:30:53,480
Let's go!

514
00:31:40,290 --> 00:31:41,150
What happened?

515
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:47,090
Who opened the door?

516
00:31:48,270 --> 00:31:49,200
Speak!

517
00:31:56,910 --> 00:31:59,170
What's wrong? She's about to give birth?

518
00:32:10,160 --> 00:32:11,310
Go tell her family

519
00:32:12,200 --> 00:32:13,510
that the pregnant woman
is about to give birth,

520
00:32:13,510 --> 00:32:15,970
and that she needs
to go to the delivery room.

521
00:32:18,700 --> 00:32:19,630
Family members?

522
00:32:19,750 --> 00:32:20,930
She is about to give birth.

523
00:32:20,930 --> 00:32:21,990
She needs to go to the delivery room.

524
00:32:21,990 --> 00:32:23,450
She's about to give birth?

525
00:32:28,810 --> 00:32:29,740
Give me the keys.

526
00:32:40,310 --> 00:32:41,120
Nobody move.

527
00:32:42,120 --> 00:32:42,920
Go over there.

528
00:32:54,770 --> 00:32:55,700
What happened?

529
00:32:56,030 --> 00:32:56,880
She went missing.

530
00:32:56,880 --> 00:32:58,280
Before our men could act.

531
00:32:59,000 --> 00:32:59,830
Inspector Su!

532
00:33:01,890 --> 00:33:03,150
Your car was hijacked.

533
00:33:04,240 --> 00:33:04,900
Where did it happen?

534
00:33:04,900 --> 00:33:05,830
At the back door.

535
00:33:09,670 --> 00:33:10,950
Captain, it's here.

536
00:33:11,240 --> 00:33:12,350
When we chased them out,

537
00:33:12,350 --> 00:33:13,990
it looked like Inspector Su's car

538
00:33:13,990 --> 00:33:15,190
drove away from here.

539
00:33:21,510 --> 00:33:22,310
Inspector Su?

540
00:33:23,070 --> 00:33:24,530
I was just looking for you.

541
00:33:24,640 --> 00:33:25,500
Where is my car?

542
00:33:27,060 --> 00:33:29,120
It seems the Communists took her away

543
00:33:29,350 --> 00:33:30,150
using your car

544
00:33:30,920 --> 00:33:31,880
right from here.

545
00:33:37,110 --> 00:33:39,170
Are you suspecting me, Captain Cang?

546
00:33:39,300 --> 00:33:40,230
I wouldn't dare.

547
00:33:41,020 --> 00:33:42,610
My driver was taken hostage,

548
00:33:42,610 --> 00:33:44,470
and the Communist was taken away.

549
00:33:44,550 --> 00:33:45,310
All of this

550
00:33:46,140 --> 00:33:48,000
is because of your incompetence.

551
00:33:49,700 --> 00:33:51,100
You'd better think about

552
00:33:51,480 --> 00:33:54,340
how to explain this to Director Li
when you get back.

553
00:34:01,690 --> 00:34:03,150
Do you really suspect her?

554
00:34:06,880 --> 00:34:08,880
Director Li will have the final say.

555
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:24,840
What did you see just now?

556
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:27,440
I saw them hijack your car.

557
00:34:28,190 --> 00:34:29,719
How many people were there?

558
00:34:30,469 --> 00:34:31,320
Three or four.

559
00:34:35,230 --> 00:34:37,280
This doesn't have anything to do with you,
does it?

560
00:34:37,280 --> 00:34:38,270
How is that possible?

561
00:34:38,270 --> 00:34:39,580
You called me here.

562
00:34:44,830 --> 00:34:46,030
You can go back first.

563
00:34:55,900 --> 00:35:00,940
[Renji Hospital]

564
00:35:20,550 --> 00:35:21,550
Besides us,

565
00:35:22,670 --> 00:35:24,800
who else would have saved Su Causeway?

566
00:35:27,760 --> 00:35:28,840
They used your car.

567
00:35:29,710 --> 00:35:31,640
I'm afraid they're coming for you.

568
00:35:32,470 --> 00:35:33,800
No matter who they were,

569
00:35:34,490 --> 00:35:35,780
I hope she's okay.

570
00:35:37,390 --> 00:35:38,920
I'm worried about her feet.

571
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:43,930
Will she ever be able to walk again?

572
00:36:03,110 --> 00:36:04,000
Sir, hurry up.

573
00:36:10,280 --> 00:36:10,810
Brother,

574
00:36:11,030 --> 00:36:12,160
we brought her back.

575
00:36:14,630 --> 00:36:15,690
Did it go smoothly?

576
00:36:17,190 --> 00:36:18,050
Minister Zhou.

577
00:36:19,320 --> 00:36:21,030
I suspect Inspector Su Men

578
00:36:22,320 --> 00:36:24,250
of colluding with the Communists.

579
00:36:25,800 --> 00:36:27,660
I will definitely find evidence.

580
00:36:28,770 --> 00:36:29,330
Yes.

581
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:32,000
Go.

582
00:36:32,590 --> 00:36:33,950
Find evidence immediately.

583
00:36:33,950 --> 00:36:35,390
You must find that car.

584
00:36:35,630 --> 00:36:36,710
It's your duty

585
00:36:37,290 --> 00:36:38,420
to see this through.

586
00:36:38,800 --> 00:36:39,530
Understood.

587
00:36:56,960 --> 00:36:58,020
Where is Shen Kexi?

588
00:37:01,440 --> 00:37:02,000
Where?

589
00:37:09,710 --> 00:37:11,710
It really was you guys who saved her?

590
00:37:12,150 --> 00:37:13,360
Ow, ow, ow!

591
00:37:15,230 --> 00:37:16,000
Let him go.

592
00:37:35,110 --> 00:37:37,440
It's almost done. Get the medicine ready.

593
00:37:55,630 --> 00:37:57,430
Where did you get this medicine?

594
00:37:57,840 --> 00:38:00,100
Penicillin is more expensive than gold.

595
00:38:00,440 --> 00:38:02,040
Gold isn't as useful as this.

596
00:38:06,230 --> 00:38:07,360
Why did you save her?

597
00:38:08,590 --> 00:38:11,520
I do whatever the Battalion Commander
tells me to do.

598
00:38:17,070 --> 00:38:18,590
Go, cut her sleeve off.

599
00:38:28,150 --> 00:38:29,110
Slowly, slowly.

600
00:38:38,320 --> 00:38:39,450
You can go out first.

601
00:38:49,030 --> 00:38:50,030
Cover her up a bit.

602
00:38:54,710 --> 00:38:55,510
Help me.

603
00:39:26,400 --> 00:39:27,130
Hold it down.

604
00:39:33,550 --> 00:39:35,360
Her life is saved.

605
00:40:11,150 --> 00:40:12,630
What exactly do you do?

606
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:15,500
You even know how to perform surgery?

607
00:40:16,760 --> 00:40:18,320
Do you know what she does?

608
00:40:21,280 --> 00:40:22,210
She's my cousin.

609
00:40:23,670 --> 00:40:24,870
What's her identity?

610
00:40:26,480 --> 00:40:28,540
A volunteer for the Ciji Foundation.

611
00:40:28,550 --> 00:40:29,680
Is that all you know?

612
00:40:33,630 --> 00:40:34,710
Let me tell you.

613
00:40:36,570 --> 00:40:37,860
She is our comrade.

614
00:40:40,550 --> 00:40:41,360
Comrade?

615
00:40:47,920 --> 00:40:49,760
You're both Communists?

616
00:40:52,110 --> 00:40:53,310
Don't we look like it?

617
00:40:54,880 --> 00:40:56,070
I just didn't expect

618
00:40:56,670 --> 00:40:58,470
that a Nationalist battalion commander
like you

619
00:40:58,470 --> 00:40:59,930
would also be a Communist.

620
00:41:01,760 --> 00:41:03,600
What's wrong with being a Communist?

621
00:41:03,600 --> 00:41:04,760
I know better than you

622
00:41:04,760 --> 00:41:07,110
how Nanjing was lost by Tang Shengzhi.

623
00:41:08,840 --> 00:41:10,770
So you joined the Communist Party?

624
00:41:14,960 --> 00:41:16,510
Then what makes you think

625
00:41:16,760 --> 00:41:18,480
my cousin is also a Communist?

626
00:41:20,960 --> 00:41:23,230
No one could endure such torture.

627
00:41:28,550 --> 00:41:30,230
She's out of danger now.

628
00:41:39,590 --> 00:41:40,390
What's wrong?

629
00:41:41,070 --> 00:41:43,070
Thank you, Battalion Commander Du.

630
00:41:43,100 --> 00:41:44,950
No, Brother Du.

631
00:41:52,400 --> 00:41:53,550
Call me Master.

632
00:42:02,110 --> 00:42:04,440
There's another thing I don't understand.

633
00:42:04,440 --> 00:42:05,230
What is it?

634
00:42:05,710 --> 00:42:06,880
How did you know

635
00:42:07,180 --> 00:42:08,840
she would be at that hospital?

636
00:42:11,760 --> 00:42:14,110
Do you have people in No. 76 too?

637
00:42:36,150 --> 00:42:38,010
Do you think it was a coincidence?

638
00:42:40,220 --> 00:42:40,970
Impossible.

639
00:42:45,360 --> 00:42:48,420
There are so many people in Shanghai
who want to harm me,

640
00:42:48,880 --> 00:42:50,880
but the only one who could pull it off

641
00:42:51,510 --> 00:42:52,280
is him.

642
00:42:56,190 --> 00:42:57,250
No matter who it is,

643
00:42:57,550 --> 00:42:59,030
they're not worth another drink.
